      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Import rare subtree patterns and Poisson declumping for Bienaymé trees (#766)

* Import rare subtree Poisson approximation and declumping

* Reduce redundant imports and expensive arithmetic elaboration

* Document offspring examples and generalize the convolution helper

