    </title>
    <updated>2026-11-05T18:38:43Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17322558?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Vilin97</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Vilin97</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Split over-long proofs in PLAcceleratedNesterovLean (#757)

* Split over-long proofs in PLAcceleratedNesterovLean

Refactor every proof over 200 lines (as measured by the syntax-aware
long-proof linter in #712) into named helper lemmas. Proof carriers
disguised as PLift-valued defs or private abbrevs become theorems.
Statements and public declarations are unchanged.

Refs #723

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

* Extract fderiv_kills_normal_of_eqOn from the local convergence proof

Main&amp;#39;s text-based proof-size check counted the statement&amp;#39;s let-bindings as
proof and reached 201 lines; extracting this self-contained step brings it
comfortably under the limit for both checkers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

---------

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/c0b2df7e44427a0b31b26cdbfcfad741ed8c916a</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/LeanPool/lean-pool/commit/c0b2df7e44427a0b31b26cdbfcfad741ed8c916a"/>
    <title>
        Split over-long proofs in AndersonConjecture (#756)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-11-05T18:38:41Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17322558?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Vilin97</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Vilin97</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Split over-long proofs in AndersonConjecture (#756)

* Split over-long proofs in AndersonConjecture

Refactor every proof over 200 lines (as measured by the syntax-aware
long-proof linter in #712) into named helper lemmas. Proof carriers
disguised as PLift-valued defs or private abbrevs become theorems.
Statements and public declarations are unchanged.

Refs #723

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

* Remove the now-unused smul_lift_of_filtration

Its only callers were replaced by the coefficient-based argument.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

* Preserve the public filtration lifting lemma

Restore the existing exported smul_lift_of_filtration contract and its bounded proof while retaining the long-proof decomposition.

The lemma remains available to downstream users even though current internal callers now use coefficient decomposition. Refs #723.

* Put theorem headers on their own line after include/omit

Main&amp;#39;s text-based proof-size check only recognizes declarations that start
a line, so one-line &amp;#39;include T in theorem&amp;#39; headers merged neighbouring
blocks into apparent 264/364-line proofs. Splitting the header is the
standard layout and keeps both checkers accurate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

---------

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/56c80a951d7c7fc9494cbcb95945461cf5e5b210</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/LeanPool/lean-pool/commit/56c80a951d7c7fc9494cbcb95945461cf5e5b210"/>
    <title>
        fix(docs): build Tau Ceti before rendering and free runner disk (#759)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-11-05T18:04:54Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17322558?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Vilin97</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Vilin97</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix(docs): build Tau Ceti before rendering and free runner disk (#759)

Daily documentation has not deployed since 2026-10-13.

- Render crashed in `doc-gen4 externals` with &amp;quot;unknown module prefix
  &amp;#39;TauCeti&amp;#39;&amp;quot;: the Mathlib cache provides Mathlib&amp;#39;s oleans, but nothing
  builds Tau Ceti in the render job. Render now builds every external,
  non-toolchain module it links to first (cached ones are no-ops).
- Since #735 fixed main build-cache saves, the restored pool build
  (~8 GB compressed) fills the docs runners&amp;#39; disk. Free the same space
  main CI does before restoring caches.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
